      "title": "MiniMax H3 I2V modes",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": ["This workflow uses the remote vLLM-Omni Generate Video node.\n\n- First-frame only (default): keep First Frame connected.\n- Last-frame only: disconnect First Frame and connect Last Frame to last_frame.\n- First+last-frame: connect both image loaders.\n\nLeave the legacy frame and references inputs disconnected. Select images from ComfyUI's input folder. H3 runs at 24 FPS; the 5.167-second duration resolves to 124 frames, satisfying 17k+5."],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
