      "title": "Optional Turbo settings",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": ["Base H3 is configured by default: 50 steps, flow_shift 12, audio_flow_shift 3.\n\nFor the shown 8-step Diffusers Turbo artifact, set its full local_path on the server, start the server with the matching preloaded LoRA, connect this Remote LoRA to Generate Video, set num_inference_steps to 9, and set flow_shift to 6. Keep audio_flow_shift at 3 and scale at 1.\n\nDo not use the _comfyui_ repack or FastH3 here."],
